<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U planning one bln skr investment.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U planning one bln skr investment.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish-American drug company Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn said on Wednesday they had begun planning a research campus in Stockholm and engineering studies showed the cost estimate was around one billion crowns.</p>
</text>
